    rdfs:label "obsolete Trigonella foenum-graecum below LD50 dose"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "OBSOLETE. A dose window of release 1.6.0 for Trigonella foenum-graecum, conditioned on the taxon alone. Replaced by a window that is also conditioned on the endpoint and the stage its source scored." ;
