                                            owl:withRestrictions ( [ xsd:minExclusive 0e+00 ] [ xsd:maxExclusive 2.7271e+02 ] ) ] ) ] ] ) ] ;
    skos:definition "A dose assessment of Triticum aestivum for seedling survival in the early seedling stage, at a dose below 272.71 Gy, below the LD50 of both varieties that Chakraborty et al. (2023) estimate." ;
    skos:scopeNote "The source irradiated doses from 200 to 450 Gy and scored viable seedlings 7 days after sowing, in two varieties; where the window extends past the tested doses, the position is arithmetic only." ;
